istors and why the voltages add to the source voltage.\n\n5. Check your own work against these answers: R_total = 8 ohm, I = 3 A, V_1 = 9 V, V_2 = 15 V, and 9 + 15 = 24 V. Correct any step that does not match, and state what you corrected.\n\nIf any step in the independent circuit is wrong and you cannot correct it yourself, that is the signal to do a short additional practice set; do not do one otherwise.",
